# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/


# Added by cargo

/target
/third_party
/.qwen
/.vulcan/
/output

# Keep documentation local by default; explicitly selected files can be added with git add -f.
# 默认将文档保留在本地；需要公开的文件可通过 git add -f 单独加入。
**/docs/

# Local review and audit artifacts.
# 本地审核与审计产物。
/docs/reviews/
.codex_tmp*

# Local task board state.
# 本地任务看板状态。
/TASK_*.md

# Generated WebUI dependencies and build outputs.
# WebUI 生成的依赖与构建产物。
/apps/vulcan-code-web/node_modules/
/apps/vulcan-code-web/dist/
/apps/vulcan-code-web/.vite/
/apps/vulcan-code-web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Electron desktop dependencies and build outputs.
# Electron 桌面端生成的依赖与构建产物。
/apps/vulcan-code-desktop/node_modules/
/apps/vulcan-code-desktop/dist/
/apps/vulcan-code-desktop/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Tauri capability schemas for the service host.
# 服务宿主生成的 Tauri 能力架构文件。
/apps/vulcan-code-service/gen/

# Local Reasonix runtime state.
# 本地 Reasonix 运行时状态。
/.reasonix/

# Vendored protoc provisioned by make init-system; required by lance-encoding via lancedb.
# 由 make init-system 取得的随仓库 protoc；lancedb 经 lance-encoding 需要它。
.cargo/protoc/
# Browser npm payloads are prepared from the frozen lockfile during make sync.
# 浏览器 npm 载荷在 make sync 期间根据冻结锁文件准备。
/plugins/vulcan-browser/node/node_modules/
